# Agent Verification Runs

Controls when the agent may run commands that cost time and tokens. **All PHP/Artisan commands via `vendor/bin/sail`.**

## Do not run unless the user explicitly asks

- Full test suite (`vendor/bin/sail artisan test` with no path filter)
- `vendor/bin/sail pest` with no path filter
- `vendor/bin/sail npm run build` · `dev` · `composer run dev`
- `vendor/bin/sail up` · `vendor/bin/sail composer install` · `vendor/bin/sail npm install`
- `vendor/bin/sail artisan migrate` · `migrate:fresh` · `db:seed` (destructive or environment-changing)
- Browser automation, dev-server startup, or manual API probing
- Re-running the same passing narrow test with no code change ("just to confirm")

## Run without asking (implementation work only)

When the user requested **code changes** or you are executing an **implementation task** from `implementation-tasks.md`:

| Command | When |
|---------|------|
| `vendor/bin/sail artisan test --compact {path}` | After changing PHP behavior — **narrowest file** covering the change |
| `vendor/bin/sail bin pint --dirty --format agent` | After editing PHP files, before finishing |
| `vendor/bin/sail artisan test --compact tests/Feature/Api/DocumentationTest.php` | After adding or changing API routes |

Examples of narrow runs:

```bash
vendor/bin/sail artisan test --compact tests/Feature/Delivery/StoreClientTest.php
vendor/bin/sail artisan test --compact tests/Unit/Core/ApiErrorCodeTest.php
```

Per `testing-required.mdc`: implementation tasks ship unit + feature + doc tests — run each **changed** test file, not the full suite.

## Do not run tests (question / review / docs-only)

When the user only asked to **explain**, **review**, **plan**, or **edit markdown/docs** with no PHP behavior change:

- Do not run Pest, Pint, or Sail builds.
- Say verification was not run if relevant.

## Conflict resolution

| Source | Rule |
|--------|------|
| This file | No full suite; no npm/build/migrate unless asked |
| `testing-required.mdc` | Unit + feature + doc test per implementation task |
| `00-lancehive-core.mdc` | Narrowest test after code change |
| User message | Explicit command request wins |

If unsure whether behavior changed, ask in one sentence before running tests.

## Report when skipped

For implementation tasks where tests were not run (e.g. Sail unavailable, user said stop):

> Narrow tests not run — run: `vendor/bin/sail artisan test --compact {path}`
